  "before_start": "Warm all solutions to 37 deg C and prepare biosafety cabinet by starting the blower and wiping down all surfaces with 70% ethanol.  Organize your workspace in the biosafety cabinet to have all clean/fresh reagents on one side and all waste on the other.  Anything you will be taking into the biosafety cabinet should also be wiped clean using 70% ethanol and paper towels",
