  "materials_text": "Complete Growth Medium containing Dulbecco\u2019s Modified Eagle\u2019s Medium (DMEM) (ATCC 30-2002). To make the  complete growth medium, add the following components to the base medium:  10% Fetal Bovine Serum (heat inactivated) (ATCC 30-2020), 2mM  L-glutamine (ATCC 30-2214), 1% Penicillin/Streptomycin.\n\nSterile 6 cm plates\nTrypsin-EDTA solution\nsterile serological pipettes (1mL and 10 mL)\n",
