    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Add 0.5mL of Trypsin-EDTA solution to flask and observe cells under an inverted microscope until cell layer is dispersed (usually within 5  00:05:00  to 15 minutes). Note: To avoid clumping do not agitate the cells by hitting or shaking the flask while waiting for the cells to detach. Cells that are difficult to detach may be placed at 37\u00b0C to facilitate dispersal. \n",
    "data": null,
